  "enhance_prompts": {
    "prompt": "structure: [Genre, Vocal Details, Arrangement]; rules:; - Genre block first: era + region + 2-3 style anchors + tempo in BPM + key if known; - Vocal Details block: gender, register, delivery manner, one signature texture; - Arrangement block: the instrument story front to back — intro, build, drop, outro; - name production adjectives the ear can verify (dusty, wide, brickwalled); - never write lyric content in the caption — that lives in the lyrics field",
    "lyrics": "structure: [section tags, rhyme, hook law]; rules:; - every section wrapped in [tag]: [verse] [pre-chorus] [chorus] [bridge] [outro]; - keep verses concrete and grounded; the chorus earns the abstraction; - the hook repeats at least once, word-for-word; - short lines sing: 6-9 syllables default, break longer thoughts; - match the section energy to the arrangement block it sits over"
